# dYOOR World: server-verified S2 holder sessions and Monad-native names.
# Use a unique random value of at least 32 characters. VERIFY_SESSION_SECRET is
# accepted as a temporary fallback, but a dedicated secret is recommended.
DYOOR_WORLD_SESSION_SECRET=
# World social automation derives purpose-separated automation and reward keys
# from DYOOR_WORLD_SESSION_SECRET. Dedicated values below are optional overrides.
# Keep rewards and sales disabled until the operator key and production flows
# have been verified. Enable each flag only in the intended Netlify context.
